{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence","id":1353035,"title":"Exalted: Essence","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-06T10:00:23-08:00","id":1353035,"title":"Exalted: Essence","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1295469-ask-the-devs-v2?p=1353034#post1353034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted Essence. Sounds really useful. Is this a real brochure of releases?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/805512154642625432/23E78B5E90721E41E46F22A4F085DACE1359DF7C/\" target=\"_blank\">https://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.n...5DACE1359DF7C/</a></div> </div> </div> </div>So that seems pretty real. What do we all think of it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T10:17:02-08:00","id":1353037,"title":"","content":"Around the release of the Third Edition corebook I jumped out Exalted's window in a rain of glass shards and ran away into the night with no intent to return. So big, so bulky, such a lack of addressing my personal problems with the system.<br /> <br /> If this is real, it is the smartest thing the developers could do, particularly given the slow development of playable character types for the longform edition. If it's good, I might come back out of the night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T10:28:35-08:00","id":1353040,"title":"","content":"Meh. <br /> <br /> (Obligatory ten character limit)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron-crowns.obsidianportal.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://exalted-golden-shackles-iron...dianportal.com</a> Visit Golden Shackles, Iron Crowns; a 3rd Edition Exalted Campaign ongoing since 2014","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2711-janissary87","name":"Janissary87","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2711_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T10:38:58-08:00","id":1353044,"title":"","content":"Courtesy of the devs over on the Exalted Discord: Being developed by Neall Raemonn Price, Dixie Cochran and Monica Valentinelli. Will have every Exalt type playable, including the ones that aren't currently out yet.<br /> <br /> Mechanically, essentially self-contained - you won't need WFHW to play Dragon-Blooded in EE. Setting details can be imported into your games.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: Simplified 3e ruleset, but won't require 3e core.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":51,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","user":"marin","date":". 12-06-2019, 01:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T10:53:14-08:00","id":1353047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353044#post1353044\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Courtesy of the devs over on the Exalted Discord: Being developed by Neall Raemonn Price, Dixie Cochran and Monica Valentinelli. Will have every Exalt type playable, including the ones that aren't currently out yet.<br /> <br /> Mechanically, essentially self-contained - you won't need WFHW to play Dragon-Blooded in EE. Setting details can be imported into your games.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: Simplified 3e ruleset, but won't require 3e core.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That seems...really dicey, so to speak. Creating a basic mechanical framework, even a simplified one for a splat requires knowing at least some of how those splats work, and doing it ahead of the extensive reasoning and design that comes with building a splat book seems like you could end up with one of two problems in the case of unreleased exalt types: either the EE version bears little to no resemblance to the actual splat, or the EE version causes later design to have to work within a design space created by EE.<br /> <br /> Admittedly, this is assuming the mechanics aren't so incredibly simplified that it simply doesn't matter how they're presented in EE, but this would still leave the same problems with fluff.<br /> <br /> Man, I hope this doesn't delay Exigents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5967-nevenkanieroda","name":"NevenkaNieroda","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:01:30-08:00","id":1353049,"title":"","content":"I think it is probably a worthwhile thing to do. Wouldn't have made any sense in prior editions because &quot;The setting *is* defined by the mechanics!&quot; (which Ex3 abandons) and because the turnover of splat books is quick enough that you're basically just eating into your potential audience, but with 3e's long turnarounds and mechanical elaboration it makes sense.<br /> <br /> Seems pretty likely to me in ways to be close to &quot;Exalted 3e rules, but without as many Charms&quot; (though I won't be surprised if the authors have other ideas!) but there's probably going to be a fair sized market out there that finds the levels of systems mastery implied by the 3e core's huge Charms section a turn off (even if the core systems beyond Charms are often argued to be perhaps not really *that* complicated), and yet doesn't want to play rules light homebrew and conversions downloaded off the internet. A book like that seems to be a good way to sell such people 3e setting books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:01:31-08:00","id":1353050,"title":"","content":"Neall and Monica at least are developing the ST Guide, which'll be giving ST-friendly previews of post-Exigents splats, so they've got an idea of what current thinking for said splats is.<br /> <br /> As for it impacting Exigents... that's still under Vance and Minton, iirc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:08:44-08:00","id":1353054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NevenkaNieroda</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353047#post1353047\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Man, I hope this doesn't delay Exigents.</div> </div> </div> </div>The impact on Exigents should be 0% as far as I understand. Multiple developers come with the nice perk that more books can be worked on at the same time.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:08:56-08:00","id":1353055,"title":"","content":"This is real, I've known about it for a while now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:13:36-08:00","id":1353056,"title":"","content":"There's clearly already a market for something like this, the number of people that have done things like try to develop FATE hacks, and as I said elsewhere I know so many people who find complexity a barrier to entry. This could open the game up considerably, with a nice professional job of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:14:51-08:00","id":1353057,"title":"","content":"Brochure's linked on the OPP front page if anyone wants to check for themselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:15:07-08:00","id":1353058,"title":"","content":"Huh. I'm honestly kinda conflicted on this one. On one hand, it could finally be the stepping stone required to make Exalted accessible to a wider audience. On the other, I can't help but echo concerns about what effect it'll have on the main gameline.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:22:54-08:00","id":1353060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353058#post1353058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh. I'm honestly kinda conflicted on this one. On one hand, it could finally be the stepping stone required to make Exalted accessible to a wider audience. On the other, I can't help but echo concerns about what effect it'll have on the main gameline.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m also conflicted. I\u2019ve taken a long time to master the complex ex3 system and I actually do like it. You can do fun stuff with it mechanically and DBs and Lunars both have a good number of charms, I feel, to be really big and diverse without going crazy.<br /> <br /> On the other hand easier to run scenes, particularly combat ones, would make the game move along a lot faster and make bigger more epic stories easier, and it will maybe make setting and mechanics arguments die a bit more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:31:09-08:00","id":1353064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NevenkaNieroda</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353047#post1353047\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That seems...really dicey, so to speak. Creating a basic mechanical framework, even a simplified one for a splat requires knowing at least some of how those splats work, and doing it ahead of the extensive reasoning and design that comes with building a splat book seems like you could end up with one of two problems in the case of unreleased exalt types: either the EE version bears little to no resemblance to the actual splat, or the EE version causes later design to have to work within a design space created by EE.<br /> <br /> Admittedly, this is assuming the mechanics aren't so incredibly simplified that it simply doesn't matter how they're presented in EE, but this would still leave the same problems with fluff.</div> </div> </div> </div>Neall, Monica, and Dixie have been involved in the discussions about how these Exalt types work for a long, long time, and we've crystallized our visions of them to a point that I can't foresee any vast divergence. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Man, I hope this doesn't delay Exigents. </div> </div> </div>It won't! Exigents is still on track.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":18}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:33:40-08:00","id":1353066,"title":"","content":"Well that explains why there's no plans for a Ex3.5, it would be foolhardy to split Ex3 in 2 when they're already planning to make an alternate edition.<br /> <br /> I'm very happy and excited about this news, I play in 2 groups, 1 hardcore and 1 more casual, so a streamlined edition would be a perfect fit for the casual group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:39:30-08:00","id":1353069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Janissary87</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353040#post1353040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Meh.<br /> <br /> (Obligatory ten character limit)</div> </div> </div> </div>this is one of those specific target audience products, that if you don\u2019t see the point of, you aren\u2019t in said target audience. Narrative, streamlined Exalted will be HUGE for a lot of people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:42:59-08:00","id":1353072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353064#post1353064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Neall, Monica, and Dixie have been involved in the discussions about how these Exalt types work for a long, long time, and we've crystallized our visions of them to a point that I can't foresee any vast divergence.<br /> <br /> <br /> It won't! Exigents is still on track.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I apologize for my lack of faith! It does sound really neat, if only for import purposes, as I am not in the target audience (granularity is my friend).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5967-nevenkanieroda","name":"NevenkaNieroda","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:48:19-08:00","id":1353074,"title":"","content":"Even if you're not in the target audience, maybe you have friends who just can't get into 3rd edition for some reason. Then you can play this game with them and the original game with others. I have a couple of friends who just don't want to play 3rd with me, but they love the setting and would definitely want to play this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T12:26:52-08:00","id":1353095,"title":"","content":"It's sharp. I'm not over the moon about it, still bitter about Heirs not being here yet, so yet another thing in the queue... even if it's a different team, salt in the wound, you know? But it's a good idea and I'm probably gonna pick it up. Exalted: Gateway Drug edition!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4086-croakamancer","name":"Croakamancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4086_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T13:01:24-08:00","id":1353111,"title":"","content":"Me: Fake.<br /> Me reading this thread: Don't toy with me like this.<br /> Me still reading: Seriously. Don't. Not funny Lioness.<br /> Me still reading: Man this is an elaborate prank.<br /> Me: Oh.<br /> ME: MY.<br /> <b><u>ME: SHUT UP AND TAKE MY MONEY!</u></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T13:18:54-08:00","id":1353121,"title":"","content":"So, I like Exalted's rules more than a lot of my players. But it is too complex, honestly. There's a lot of bloat, a lot of rules that aren't bad but just make it more difficult to run, and there are some rules that actually aren't very good (like grappling). At the same time, I don't want a really, really, really simplified system that becomes boring. I like that Exalted has rules for combat, social, craft, naval combat, etc, that most games don't bother with.<br /> I just want... about 33% simpler. Maybe 50%. Not a narrative game like FATE or whatever.<br /> <br /> I don't know what they're aiming for here, but if it includes all splats, I imagine it'll be fairly simple. Obviously, after all, they can't do long charmlists for each splat.<br /> <br /> I also wonder whether it'll be similar to White Wolf games generally (will you still have Attributes+Ability pools of d10s?), or completely different.<br /> <br /> <br /> So: Good idea, I'll see what it's like.<br /> <br /> I think my STs in the two Essence 5 games I play will be keen. I don't know if I'll use it for my Essence 2 Lunar game. Depends what it's like really.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 12-06-2019, 04:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T13:24:09-08:00","id":1353124,"title":"","content":"I tried running EX3 for IRL pals a while back (pre-What Fire Has Wrought; I used Crumple's brew to make the DB NPCs) and they said they didn't really enjoy the system. I'd love if this were a system to have Exalted fun with people who don't jive with the regular ruleset.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T13:24:42-08:00","id":1353125,"title":"","content":"Well, I'm interested, to say the least. I know that I have several friends for whom &quot;A simpler streamlined Exalted&quot; would be a huge hit.<br /> <br /> Plus the ability to kitbash future splats before 2025 when Internals gets started","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T13:53:26-08:00","id":1353141,"title":"","content":"I'm looking forward to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThe very existence of flame-throwers proves that some time, somewhere, someone said to themselves, You know, I want to set those people over there on fire, but I'm just not close enough to get the job done.\u201d George Carlin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/123-trax","name":"Trax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar123_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T13:57:41-08:00","id":1353143,"title":"","content":"Finally. This can only be a good thing in my book.<br /> <br /> Trying to get any non-Exalted person interested in Exalted right now is all but impossible. It's just way too complex for the current environment. People have literally recoiled from me when I told them the page length of the core book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/845-dragonmystic","name":"Dragonmystic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T14:23:57-08:00","id":1353148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353055#post1353055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is real, I've known about it for a while now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Anything you can tell us about it? Or not really? (Either because you don't know or feel you can't tell us.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T14:24:56-08:00","id":1353149,"title":"","content":"Goooood lord yes. &quot;I wish they had streamlined for Ex3&quot; has literally been the biggest complaint I've heard about the current edition from people who dropped the game. This is the only chance Exalted currently has to expand its market.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Current project: <a href=\"https://monsterambulance.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Monster Ambulance</a>, wherein you save monsters. In your ambulance.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2240-colin_fredericks","name":"Colin_Fredericks","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2240_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T14:27:57-08:00","id":1353151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Colin_Fredericks</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353149#post1353149\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Goooood lord yes. &quot;I wish they had streamlined for Ex3&quot; has literally been the biggest complaint I've heard about the current edition from people who dropped the game. T<i><b>his is the only chance Exalted currently has to expand its market</b></i>.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I am not sure that the above highlighted statement is true... We have expanded the Market for EX3 by adding new players never before exposed here and we use the EX3 Current Big Book...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The problem with defending the purity of the English language is that English is about as pure as a cribhouse whore. We don't just borrow words; on occasion, English has pursued other languages down alleyways to beat them unconscious and rifle their pockets for new vocabulary. - James. D. Nicoll</span></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/540-tymeaus-jalynsfein","name":"Tymeaus Jalynsfein","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T14:31:14-08:00","id":1353152,"title":"","content":"Some people like it. Others don't. I find more people like the fluff, the world, and the tone of the game (ie yes you can take over a kingdom with starting characters) than like the ruleset.<br /> <br /> I'd say one of my players likes the rules (though he also likes to complain about them), some dislike it as they find it too complex, and some don't have any strong opinions on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T14:34:26-08:00","id":1353153,"title":"","content":"So, Neall Reamon Price, who is one of the writers here, is one of the creatrs of the Storypath system, which I don't know a lot about. Have any of you played it? What's it like?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T19:06:19-08:00","id":1353205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353153#post1353153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, Neall Reamon Price, who is one of the writers here, is one of the creatrs of the Storypath system, which I don't know a lot about. Have any of you played it? What's it like?</div> </div> </div> </div>\\o Scion 2e player here. Honestly, I think Storypath is a big improvement over Storyteller. To the point where I kind of wanted to make a Storypath hack of Exalted. There's a few things that take some getting used to, but here's a few things I love which I will list here.<ul><li>The Path system is pretty solid. It can vary depending on Scion and Trinity, but essentially Paths are like beefed-up Qualities from Fate, and can be used to justify bonuses to skill rolls, equipment, and social contacts. In most Storypath games, your Paths determine your Skill points in CharGen.<ul><li>Example, a hypothetical Path of Exalts, a Scavenger Lord Path could be used by the player to go &quot;I'm invoking my Path and saying I know a smuggler who can put us on the trail of these drug shipments&quot;</li> </ul></li> <li>The Crafting system in Scion is pretty excellent. It's like the opposite of the Ex3 Craft System. To build something, you need to accomplish a number of Milestones, and have a Path that justify it. No building of smaller things to get to bigger things. No points to keep track of. Hell, if you spend time obtaining a logical material, that can count towards the project without even rolling.<ul><li>Hypothetical Path of Exalts parallel: Amilar Harken, who has the Path of &quot;Twilight Exalt&quot;, wants to build a sword. This is an entirely mortal weapon, so would probably only require three or so Milestones. Drafting plans with a Close Combat + Intellect roll would be one Milestone, the Night Caste using their contacts to get some quality iron (Or Chiaroscuro Glass, if you're feeling exotic) would be another Milestone, and a scene of working in his forge would count as another Milestone. Bing bang boom, he made a sword. For something like a Daiklave, he'd need more Milestones, and would need to work harder to get more exotic ingredients.</li> <li>One could probably also use this system for an Occult-based project for the purposes of replicating Sorcerous Workings in the hypothetical Path of Exalts.</li> </ul></li> <li>The Attributes are a bit different. They're organized by Arena and Approach.<ul><li>The Arenas are basically the kinds of actions: Physical, Social, and Mental.</li> <li>Approach represents the methodology. You have Force, Finesse, and Resilience, demonstrating whether you power through a challenge, weave around a challenge, or outlast a challenge.</li> <li>You combine these into your Attributes.<ul><li>Physical: Might (Force), Dexterity (Finesse), and Stamina (Resilience)</li> <li>Social: Presence (Force), Manipulation (Finesse), and Composure (Resilience)</li> <li>Mental: Intellect (Force), Cunning (Finesse), and Resolve (Resilience)</li> </ul></li> </ul></li> <li>Now this one takes a bit of getting used to. If you're used to Storyteller, Storypath plays a bit looser with usual Ability+Attribute combinations.<ul><li>Example, instead of using a Craft <i>skill</i>, you roll with the Skill that's associated with the thing you're making. So repairing a wagon would use the Pilot skill, while recognizing the martial arts style your foe is using would use the Close Combat Skill with a Mental Quality.</li> <li>This throws a lot of people: There's no flat Perception Skill in most Storypath games. Most of them use Mental checks with the most relevant skill. Example, it may be Empathy to notice that the person you're talking to is acting <i>too</i> calm, and is palming a knife to stab you. It would be a Survival check to realize that it's <i>too</i> quiet, and a twig just snapped ominously.</li> </ul></li> <li>The dice pools and difficulties are reined in slightly. Difficulty rarely goes above 5, and increasing dice pools isn't done through countless effects. It's usually done by spending a resource called Momentum, which I'll describe down the list.<ul><li>Difficulties can be adjusted through Complications. Complications to a roll are generally a sort of &quot;Yes, <i>but</i>-&quot; to add to checks. For instance, you're climbing a fence, and the fence has spikes and blades along the top. Climbing the fence itself is an Athletics check, Difficulty 1. However, the spikes are a 2-rank Complication, and if you don't buy that off with extra successes, you still clear the fence, but may take an Injury, or leave behind a scrap of your clothing that a tracker may find. So you need one success to climb the fence, but three to climb and evade the blades on top.</li> <li>While Storypath doesn't use Dice Adders as much as Storyteller, it <i>does</i> use bonus successes, called Enhancement. Enhancement generally only applies if you roll a success on the skill roll, so botches are still very much a risk, but they also represent things like having better equipment.</li> </ul></li> <li>Oh! This is big. Stunts aren't things you describe beforehand, they're little bonuses to succeed better after you've already succeeded. You spend threshold successes on them.<ul><li>An example I saw from Scion. Imagine you're climbing the bladed fence, and manage to clear it and buy off the Complication. You have some bonus thresholds, and with the Storyguide (GM for Storypath) you agree that you can spend your last two successes to break the spikes in a way that you remove the Complication in your wake. Thus, your friends can scamper after you without worrying about the spikes.</li> </ul></li> <li>Scale! Scale is a great mechanic. Scale is for comparing two things that are on vastly different levels. Two humans having a footrace would be done by comparing Athletics skill checks, but if one of the racers is a Sorcerer on a Stormwind Rider, then the Stormwind would have Scale over the humans. Scale is how you would go &quot;Oh that's not even FAIR&quot;<ul><li>Scale is also how you would represent super huge opponents, such as giant monsters or Warstriders. It would probably also be ways for Exalts to pump up their power relative to baseline humans.</li> </ul></li> <li>And one of my favorite mechanics: Momentum. Momentum is a communal resource that can be spent for bonuses. Most often, THIS is how you add bonus dice to your rolls. It's generally generated by failing rolls, or when injuries and other negative Conditions inconvenience you.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> However I'm pretty sure the devs have said that Exalted Essence is <i>not</i> a Storypath hack for Exalted. Which NGL, a <i>little</i> disappointed at, but hey, Neall's earned my trust. Cool dude.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T21:55:42-08:00","id":1353248,"title":"","content":"Kind of my feelings on some stuff with Scion:<br /> <br /> I like Composure as an Attribute, but I think that Resolve was not a good on-its-own Attribute in CofD, and don't htink it is in Exalted either. Having both always felt like forced symmetry in a way I don't like. I'd rather keep Composure (It's good to hang Charms on and it can have some good Ability combos) but keep Perception myself. I think the latter is only a bad Attribute if you think you have to force a 3x3 arena-focus thing.<br /> <br /> Scale I think works better when there's like, more things at different scales to compare. Exalted has a thing where Exalts are in general, kind of the same (human-sized-shaped-things) and that you are not oftne comparing non-human-scaled-things with one-another in a way that you do with Scion I feel. Basically Exalted 3e I find went just a different route and falttened things. If you're above a certain size, you're Legendary Sized. If you're below a certain size, you're a Tiny Creature. I'd argue something scale-like is there for size, but it's just like....not as big a scale. And for humand-sized stuff that's not important, it's just a trivial opponent. It basically doesn't right now assume the wriggle room that Scion or TC wanted, isntead going for the more grounded/flatter curve. Something ot keep in mind when I see it sold for Exalted. The setting kind of has to assume it needs it, and I think it works better for something like 2e's take of the setting than 3e's generally flatter one.<br /> <br /> I think some Scale-like stuff culd have existed in some areas like speed and a clearer size mechanic, but I think there are aspects with it that didn't fit with 3e's design goals. One of them being the whole &quot;Scale of 3+ more, you win&quot; stuff. I think 3e in general tried to by design avoid the whole &quot;Things below a certain scale are irrelevant bugs&quot; thing. This is again, why you don't have real extra slike before, and trivial opponents are entirely narrative rather than some thing that is measured by IC power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T02:29:50-08:00","id":1353291,"title":"","content":"This is incredible news. Sign me up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T02:45:01-08:00","id":1353294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353205#post1353205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">However I'm pretty sure the devs have said that Exalted Essence is <i>not</i> a Storypath hack for Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Was that on the Discord?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T03:47:45-08:00","id":1353308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353205#post1353205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[*]The Path system is pretty solid.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm... I think I'd want to see these in more detail. That sounds like it could be good, or could be a popular part of modern games design that I don't like (not saying it's bad, just not my cup of tea).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Crafting system in Scion... Drafting plans with a Close Combat + Intellect roll would be one Milestone, the Night Caste using their contacts to get some quality iron (Or Chiaroscuro Glass, if you're feeling exotic) would be another Milestone, and a scene of working in his forge would count as another Milestone. Bing bang boom, he made a sword. For something like a Daiklave, he'd need more Milestones, and would need to work harder to get more exotic ingredients. </div> </div> </div>This does sound a bit better, as long as people can't b*llshit easy ones. We've often said how it's a pity that the Exalted system doesn't really go into the quests for the exotic materials, which ought to be the most interesting part of forging magical weapons.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> [*]The Attributes are a bit different. They're organized by Arena and Approach. </div> </div> </div>These remind me of NWoD. It's kind of the wrong lesson. Storyteller has its issues, but I don't think the Attributes chosen are a big issue. You can try to make them more logical and cross-equivalent (like giving each a Power, Finesse, Defence), but humans aren't really like that. Composure and Resolve don't immediately explain themselves to me clearly in genre-terms compared to Appearance (which, for a lot of games, ought to just be a Merit or something, but I could see Holden's point that it's much easier to design genre-appropriate Appearance charms for Lunars and Alchemicals than Composure charms).<br /> <br /> Not saying it doesn't work for Scion (haven't played it). But for a simpler Exalted, it'd be better to just have less Attributes/Abilities than different ones. Which is the only thing Vance has given away about the system really.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> [*]Example, instead of using a Craft <i>skill</i>, you roll with the Skill that's associated with the thing you're making. So repairing a wagon would use the Pilot skill, while recognizing the martial arts style your foe is using would use the Close Combat Skill with a Mental Quality. </div> </div> </div> I like that. Not sure that you'd want to do that with Exalted (I mean, there definitely shouldn't be tons of different Craft skills!), but you could. I guess you could also easily have Craft powers (charms, or whatever) that aren't connected to the abilities, so your super-crafty Exalt applies their craft powers to their mediocre Melee skill, Sail skill, Survival skill, or whatever.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> [*]This throws a lot of people: There's no flat Perception Skill in most Storypath games. Most of them use Mental checks with the most relevant skill. Example, it may be Empathy to notice that the person you're talking to is acting <i>too</i> calm, and is palming a knife to stab you. It would be a Survival check to realize that it's <i>too</i> quiet, and a twig just snapped ominously. </div> </div> </div>I like that too. Means you get people rolling less-used skills more often. Survival, Larceny (for noticing thugs), etc.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The dice pools and difficulties are reined in slightly. Difficulty rarely goes above 5, and increasing dice pools isn't done through countless effects. </div> </div> </div>That'd make running Exalted a bit quicker.<br /> <br /> <br /> I will say though, honestly, the dice pools aren't really the reason why Exalted is so complex. I don't love the massive dice pools, it does slow things down, but the reasons Exalted is hard to run sometimes isn't the core mechanic of Attribute+Ability, it's having 15-50 charms each and the movement rules and remembering motes/mote regen/anima/overwhelming penalties/initiative/health levels/wound penalties/dice bonuses/re-rolls/doubles/dice caps*/willpower.<br /> <br /> *It makes me really sad how the Lunar writers tried to make turning into animals cool and simple and easy and balanced, but accidentally made it mind-bogglingly confusing for half my players due to the way the dice caps work. My players are bad enough at dice caps anyway, but I have to remind them everytime they shapechange. I think some are probably better at it than others, but the ones who are better shapechange less.<br /> <br /> That's the stuff that needs simplifying. I've no big issue if they reduce 34 Attributes/Abilities to 10, but reducing it to 25 would be fine, it's all the other stuff<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T04:01:41-08:00","id":1353311,"title":"","content":"I would be very interested. It would be an interesting way to do a &quot;soft relaunch&quot; of the system, given that it's been a long time coming with various corebooks, and so a way to keep up attention on the game.<br /> <br /> Also would be good to have tools to build every splat ever on a rough framework other than the &quot;assign dice pools as you like&quot; from the Quick Characters section. Particularly as one of my players may be about to taint their Essence by trying to purify a Shadowlands demesne by routing the leylines through themselves...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T04:24:36-08:00","id":1353314,"title":"","content":"According to devs on Discord it won't use Storypath, but does use the same dice dice basics as 3e. Attribute+ability, tn7, double 10s.<br /> Akin to Fate Accelerated to Fate Core.<br /> Also Getimians will have 4 castes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8011-imadaman","name":"imadaman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8011_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T05:15:53-08:00","id":1353318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>imadaman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353314#post1353314\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">According to devs on Discord it won't use Storypath, but does use the same dice dice basics as 3e. Attribute+ability, tn7, double 10s.<br /> Akin to Fate Accelerated to Fate Core.<br /> Also Getimians will have 4 castes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the update.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Attribute+ability, tn7, double 10s. </div> </div> </div>I don't love this, and I don't hate it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Akin to Fate Accelerated to Fate Core. </div> </div> </div>I'm afraid I'm not familiar with Fate Accelerated.<br /> <br /> <br /> I actually have Discord, I use it for my Blood Bowl League, how do you get onto the Exalted discord?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 12-07-2019, 08:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T05:31:50-08:00","id":1353322,"title":"","content":"Exalted Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6WyJHPU\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/6WyJHPU</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800080\">I express my opinions, but YSMV; Your Stories May Vary.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><i>Formerly known as wyrmpuff</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12288-mal-akh","name":"Mal'akh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12288_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T06:23:31-08:00","id":1353328,"title":"","content":"What I would like to know, above all else, is what the combat is gonna be like. See, I love pretty much everything about 3rd. I think the lore is better, I think the charms are better, I adore how they make the rule for Supernal skills and then immediately realise how that means that EVERY single skill had to be made a viable pick - and then they did that! Character creation is cooler, essence increase is better, and I have flat-out stolen intimacies for character creation sessions in other systems. <br /> <br /> But...! <br /> <br /> I hate the combat system. With fiery passion. I worked and slaved away on making that system fun. And I think I cracked the code... Once! We had ONE fun combat. It involved a brotherhood of dragonbloods, a solar ghost, and the players. I had stated the entire brotherhood and the ghost. And once the combat was over, they were all useless. So to make a single combat work, I had to put hours and hours of prep in for ONE fight. Prep I did not even find fun - and I normally enjoy my GM prep. I find it relaxing. <br /> <br /> I have many, many, many(!) more grievances for the combat, but this sorta turned into an unintentional rant... My point is, the combat being so shit is, sadly, a dealbreaker for me. So I have pretty much left Exalted. And it especially hurts when the rest is, as I said, saliva inducing awesome. <br /> <br /> So if this streamlined system fixes the combat? I am in! Though, I fear it\u2019ll still be using that dreaded initiativ system...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1521,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1521-jang","user":"Jang","date":". 12-07-2019, 09:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1521-jang","name":"Jang","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1521_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T06:25:18-08:00","id":1353329,"title":"","content":"I agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar353_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"353\" data-vbnamecard=\"353\">Blaque</a> about Perception as an attribute. Sure, Appearance -&gt; Composure, fine. Wits -&gt; Resolve... eh. Charisma -&gt; Presence, I only have trouble with this because I started in Storyteller games with 2nd Ed Vampire, which means when someone says Presence, I think supernatural vampire powers, not average person. But Perception? Come on, it was probably the biggest change in the RPG world at the time*.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> *Storyteller is the first system I know of where Perception was an Attribute, as opposed to appended to some mental stat as a side benefit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;At the risk of sounding like a murder hobo&quot;<br /> <br /> Attributed to Nyrufa.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24134-inertial-frame","name":"Inertial Frame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T06:29:47-08:00","id":1353330,"title":"","content":"I was initially weirded out, becuase my gut reaction was to think it was an &quot;Exalted 3.5&quot;, but if it's something more of an &quot;Exalted Lite&quot;, I'm game.<br /> <br /> My main interest is to get a sneak peek at Sidereals, Getimians and Dream-souled ahead of schedule. If we are going to get a sneak peek at them, that is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1578-patricl_gleason","name":"Patricl_Gleason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1578_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"26"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T06:46:55-08:00","id":1353333,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Patricl_Gleason</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353330#post1353330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was initially weirded out, becuase my gut reaction was to think it was an &amp;quot;Exalted 3.5&amp;quot;, but if it's something more of an &amp;quot;Exalted Lite&amp;quot;, I'm game.<br /> <br /> My main interest is to get a sneak peek at Sidereals, Getimians and Dream-souled ahead of schedule. If we are going to get a sneak peek at them, that is.</div> </div> </div> </div>No Dream-souled or other optional ones from Exigent Appendix, but should have Sids, Gets, Lims, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8011-imadaman","name":"imadaman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8011_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T06:56:58-08:00","id":1353335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353318#post1353318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm afraid I'm not familiar with Fate Accelerated.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fate Accelerated is the simplified version of the Fate Core system. It keeps Fate's Aspects intact, replaces the Skill list with a tight list of Approaches, and uses Fate's Stunt system to carry the load of the Core's slightly more complex powers and exceptions. Its language and design are geared toward younger players, and I think it'd be appropriate for playing, say, Harry Potter.<br /> <br /> If you're also not familiar with Fate Core, it's a setting-agnostic generic system with an emphasis on narrative back-and-forth and fail-forward mechanics, appropriate for pulpy adventures. I've used it to run a less-combat-focused game in the Mass Effect setting, and it worked well.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hey, check out my first original RPG, <i>Post-Mortem, </i>here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem</a><br /> <br /> Or read my Exalted novella <i>The Silence of Our Ancestors</i> here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/304805/The-Silence-of-Our-Ancestors-A-DragonBlooded-Novella\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...looded-Novella</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1961-dex-davican","name":"Dex Davican","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T07:10:14-08:00","id":1353338,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jang</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353328#post1353328\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had stated the entire brotherhood and the ghost. And once the combat was over, they were all useless.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why? NPC character sheets are a renewable resource and you can acheve a fair bit of variance just by changing the weapon/armour options.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T07:15:34-08:00","id":1353342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mal'akh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353322#post1353322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6WyJHPU\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/6WyJHPU</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Patricl_Gleason</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">My main interest is to get a sneak peek at Sidereals, Getimians and Dream-souled ahead of schedule. If we are going to get a sneak peek at them, that is. <hr /></div> </div> </div> </div>Dream-Souled will be in Exigents, the raw text of which will be out to backers before this anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T07:18:13-08:00","id":1353343,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353318#post1353318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm afraid I'm not familiar with Fate Accelerated.</div> </div> </div> </div>For comparison purposes: the <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/114903/Fate-Core-System\" target=\"_blank\">Fate Core System</a> is 308 pages. <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/114902/Fate-Accelerated-Edition-o-A-Fate-Core-Build\" target=\"_blank\">Fate Accelerated Edition</a> is 48 pages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T07:32:32-08:00","id":1353347,"title":"","content":"Generally, I'm not a fan of rules-lite variants. A lot of them are jumpstart/quickstart kits that only contain some of the rules, which is totally fine for a jumpstart kick to do to make things easier for totally new players, but doesn't interest me because it feels like I'm buying an incomplete version of the game when I could just wait and buy the real version when it comes out instead. Looking at you, Cyberpunk Red. <br /> <br /> The ones that are meant to be a complete ruleset have a tendency to streamline or cut out the parts of the system that I like or that I appreciate for what they are. Looking at you, Shadowrun Anarchy. <br /> <br /> For me, there's just a lot of... disinterest by association? Not sure what to call it. I like the product in principle for people who need it, but previous experiences with similar products have turned me off to the idea.<br /> <br /> There's a good chance I'd buy it just for the lore on the Exalted though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T08:01:28-08:00","id":1353350,"title":"","content":"As someone who tried Exalted 3e multiple times with multiple groups of players, this is exciting news. A lot of those attempts died because of the bloated Charm section and the higher degree of overall system complexity compared to older editions, so a thorough streamlining might help fix those issues. Depends on what exactly gets &quot;streamlined&quot;, of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T08:10:57-08:00","id":1353353,"title":"","content":"Indeed, you can't really say until you see it. I think it's a good idea, but it does depend of course.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353347#post1353347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's a good chance I'd buy it just for the lore on the Exalted though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bear in mind that this isn't even finished as a First Draft. It's possible that the ST Companion (Crucibles of Legend), which will have QCs of Getimians, Liminals, etc, will be out first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T08:16:37-08:00","id":1353356,"title":"","content":"So, two new things from <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/onyx-path-publishing-announces-new-exalted-essence-corebook/\" target=\"_blank\">the press release</a>:<br /> <br /> 1) Work on it will begin in 2020, and it's slated for a Kickstarter<br /> 2) It'll have Universal Charms (including Martial Arts) that work across multiple Exalt types, as well as some Charms that are unique to specific Exalt types.<br /> <br /> Also, correcting my earlier post, it's Monica Speca who's co-developing EE.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T08:37:56-08:00","id":1353360,"title":"","content":"It does sound like it's a fairly new project. I'm guessing the Kickstarter will be 2021 then.<br /> <br /> For a simpler system, there's no real reason why your basic &quot;punch harder/jump higher/balance better/take more punishment&quot; kung-fu trope powers can't be the same for all of them, as long as there's still plenty of differentiation in other ways. The fact that one splat's perfect defence costs 2m more isn't that necessary when you can just give them different mote pools (give Solars the most, DBs the least, etc).<br /> <br /> You obviously do want to avoid Lunars being Silver Solars+Shapeshifting though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T09:25:48-08:00","id":1353373,"title":"","content":"Hm. This is pretty much what I've been wanting for awhile now. Fingers crossed this turns out alright.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T12:50:09-08:00","id":1353403,"title":"","content":"So, it has begun... *MORTAL KOMBAT MUSIC*<br /> <br /> I do hope this project is successful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T16:44:49-08:00","id":1353448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353360#post1353360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You obviously do want to avoid Lunars being Silver Solars+Shapeshifting though.</div> </div> </div> </div> This time we're going for different flavors of Lunar. Gold Lunars, Twinkly Lunars, Planeteer Lunars, the works.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hey, check out my first original RPG, <i>Post-Mortem, </i>here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem</a><br /> <br /> Or read my Exalted novella <i>The Silence of Our Ancestors</i> here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/304805/The-Silence-of-Our-Ancestors-A-DragonBlooded-Novella\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...looded-Novella</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1961-dex-davican","name":"Dex Davican","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T18:11:00-08:00","id":1353462,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dex Davican</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353448#post1353448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> This time we're going for different flavors of Lunar. Gold Lunars, Twinkly Lunars, Planeteer Lunars, the works.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't forget Goth Lunars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T18:20:10-08:00","id":1353464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Janissary87</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353040#post1353040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Meh.<br /> <br /> (Obligatory ten character limit)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Indeed? Another restart? Meh. I'll probably buy it though. Again.<br /> <br /> They need to do a amazing pitch on the Kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8757-pram","user":"Pram","date":". 12-07-2019, 09:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8757-pram","name":"Pram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T18:30:38-08:00","id":1353466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dex Davican</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353448#post1353448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> This time we're going for different flavors of Lunar. Gold Lunars, Twinkly Lunars, Planeteer Lunars, the works.</div> </div> </div> </div>How about mint choc chip Lunars?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T18:34:03-08:00","id":1353467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353464#post1353464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Indeed? Another restart? Meh. I'll probably buy it though. Again.</div> </div> </div> </div>I asked the writers, it's a one-off book and then things will continue with the rules from the Core Book.<br /> <br /> (I wouldn't be surprised if, if it's well-received, in 10 years time they release an Ex4 that takes ideas from the normal Ex3 rules and Essence. But that's in 10 years.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T19:48:50-08:00","id":1353475,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353467#post1353467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I asked the writers, it's a one-off book and then things will continue with the rules from the Core Book.<br /> <br /> (I wouldn't be surprised if, if it's well-received, in 10 years time they release an Ex4 that takes ideas from the normal Ex3 rules and Essence. But that's in 10 years.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I just fine that they should give more details.<br /> <br /> Right now, unless it's a very interesting add-on or change on the combat system, my level of hype won't budge that much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8757-pram","name":"Pram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T20:01:55-08:00","id":1353479,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353475#post1353475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I just fine that they should give more details.<br /> <br /> Right now, unless it's a very interesting add-on or change on the combat system, my level of hype won't budge that much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Given that it's just an announcement, and they haven't even gotten past the initial system design (Per Monica, it's in &quot;alpha&quot;), I doubt we're getting any details for the time being. Because they don't exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T20:05:27-08:00","id":1353480,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353479#post1353479\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Given that it's just an announcement, and they haven't even gotten past the initial system design (Per Monica, it's in &quot;alpha&quot;), I doubt we're getting any details for the time being. Because they don't exist.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Welp... playing the waiting game again. That's what I'm used too <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8757-pram","name":"Pram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T20:07:16-08:00","id":1353481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353475#post1353475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Right now, unless it's a very interesting add-on or change on the combat system, my level of hype won't budge that much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>You know, the key thing to understand about a product such as this is that not everybody is its audience. And there's nothing... noteworthy, at all, about not being part of its audience.<br /> <br /> Some people will do far better with the game as it is, some will find this the actual means of getting into it at all.<br /> <br /> Heh, back in the day I think the New World of Darkness managed to put out something like three books like this in the core line alone.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I don't think it's necessary for anybody who is not part of the intended audience to be hostile about the thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-08T02:08:36-08:00","id":1353507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353475#post1353475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I just fine that they should give more details.<br /> <br /> Right now, unless it's a very interesting add-on or change on the combat system, my level of hype won't budge that much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I think it definitely will have a different (simpler) combat system. How different it'll be I have no idea of course.<br /> <br /> Not to say you have to be enthusiastic. Some of my players would love a simpler system. If you don't, that's fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-08T03:06:52-08:00","id":1353513,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353338#post1353338\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why? NPC character sheets are a renewable resource and you can acheve a fair bit of variance just by changing the weapon/armour options.</div> </div> </div> </div>I disagree. For me, I needed to have a pretty intuitive grasp their charms to run things smoothly; anything else would ruin the pace because of book diving. Reusing their stats with only minor tweaks felt incredibly same-y, as the greatest variance came from their charms. <br /> <br /> I should also say, this wasn\u2019t the only or necessarily biggest grievance I had. It was just what tipped the scales for me, and it kind of formed the beginning of the end for my time in 3rd ed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1521-jang","name":"Jang","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1521_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-08T03:08:58-08:00","id":1353514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353462#post1353462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Don't forget Goth Lunars.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lunars who climb on rocks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-08T05:08:44-08:00","id":1353527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jang</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1353513#post1353513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I disagree. For me, I needed to have a pretty intuitive grasp their charms to run things smoothly; anything else would ruin the pace because of book diving. Reusing their stats with only minor tweaks felt incredibly same-y, as the greatest variance came from their charms.</div> </div> </div> </div> There's things I could pick at here but you've already made up your mind.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_