e doc but i don't think its complete.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-12T22:44:19-07:00","id":1396123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1353035-exalted-essence?p=1396118#post1396118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exalted Essence Actual Play/Test Play. Now should be on the OPP youtube<br /> As for the specifics, I think someone is currently collecting all the details of the stream in one doc but i don't think its complete.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1D5ejH585oYLEEtGUTzT0kO9R4u3ZbVCJ01jVDzEZcG8\" target=\"_blank\">Here's what I got from my first watch</a> with some additional details gleamed here and there. Warning: I haven't bothered to actually sort it into something more than &quot;Trying to group relevant information together&quot;<br /> <br /> Apparently there's gonna be another play on Sunday at 11am EST, with Minton as a player. I'll be watching that one as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date"